{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bed9fb1e4e0d405649aa05c5204c73abde5da7e4040bf8ad6a2897f161dbb258", "ja": "（『アイドルヒーローズ』シリーズのリバイバル公演に\n向けて、響はいつにも増して気合い十分のようだ）", "zh": "（为了《偶像英雄》系列的复刻公演，响似乎比平时更加干劲十足。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1001_p", "source_sha256": "818bb6ed5819c0068e3606ec32ce663f255bbacc5a3a21613f3f17521fab482f", "ja": "響、お疲れ様。\nずいぶんと、気合いが入っているな。", "zh": "响，辛苦了。看来你干劲十足啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "20f2fdfed3cb49b3a04e882b2a59ddadab419595229e7f8920b458b05a838af5", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。うん！\nだって自分、ヒーローズには絶対勝ちたいからね！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。嗯！\n因为我绝对想赢过英雄队嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a9168b3f8e6f0531469605316d99e109df7f6ac1fc14e4fb0f4615f5b0b90828", "ja": "勝ちたい？　でも物語の展開としては、\n最後には負けることになるけど……？", "zh": "想赢？可是按照故事的发展，最后还是会输掉的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "7341786a96e6207d9c9c4417d3a3dfbac02a7769814acd9cf5cab2d990c8de7c", "ja": "あははっ、違うぞ！\n勝ちたいっていうのは、演技の話！", "zh": "啊哈哈，不对啦！\n我说想赢，是指演戏的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "0c10e82f0e40c7e2f92bb5c3f5a80a0633fc51d274a3d17d5b78aeab2034bf10", "ja": "自分、いろいろ考えたんだ。\n悪役だから、負けちゃうのは決まってるけど……。", "zh": "我认真想了想。既然是反派，注定是要输的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "b032a22642478a4f155233284939a24aefd64275f02468cdee8aaee82188424f", "ja": "逆に言えば、負ける前は全部自分たちの見せ場だぞ！\n思いっきりカッコよく決めなくちゃ！", "zh": "反过来说，在输掉之前，全都是我们大显身手的机会啊！一定要尽情帅气地表现一番！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1007_p", "source_sha256": "eaebb3962782ff4668bcb59e07721b60a6e5d16f3999e7640978f73c827ce0db", "ja": "見せ場か。そういえばずっと楽しみにしていたな。\nやっと巨大怪獣デストラオンのお披露目だって。", "zh": "压轴戏吗。说起来一直很期待呢。\n说是终于要登场了——巨型怪兽德斯特拉昂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "73a2c9fe9385eec1612ea17b656ff9a2890dcd897f52591d064b63325e6c39a0", "ja": "そうそう！　前は地球の反対側でワームホールに\n入れなくて、出番がちょっとしかなかったからね。", "zh": "没错没错！之前在地球的另一边没能进入虫洞，出场时间只有一点点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "df424670a24258c62b8415e596926b621f398351a74845b6b712ee07169a7b86", "ja": "でも、すごくカッコいいデザインの怪獣だし、\n性格もかわいい感じの子なんだ！", "zh": "不过，它可是设计得超帅的怪兽，而且性格也很可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "7248a43a55a698e65cbe1ad2cce8c27021177d80356479883fdd15ec2a3f70f7", "ja": "今回はちゃんと出番があるから、自分とのコンビで\n絶対人気が出るはずだぞっ。楽しみさ～。", "zh": "这次我也会好好出场，所以和我组成搭档的话，肯定会大受欢迎的啦。真让人期待啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1011_p", "source_sha256": "08837929c06cb7dac61e01c67feef6e0753e27966a26998a9ab5d6c0e5384f2e", "ja": "役回り的には敵側でも、爪痕を残したいってやつだな。\n確かに忘れられない悪役っているよな……。", "zh": "就算是反派角色，也想留下让人深刻的印记对吧。\n确实有些反派让人难以忘怀呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "183c444d956bc54e7eb8c96ee639ef71f33e3894565dc4dda9198e09bb23cb35", "ja": "そうそれ！　インパクトだったら、\n自分たちが勝ってもいいんだよね？", "zh": "对对！要是论冲击力的话，我们赢了也没关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "f48396e76e11e3cc73a80c630ec821a2fe156b39e8baf282983c246e1851e0be", "ja": "だから、まず自分が圧倒的な実力でヒーローズを\nねじ伏せて、這いつくばらせてやるんだ！", "zh": "所以，首先我要用压倒性的实力彻底击溃HEROES，让他们匍匐在地！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e50ffed8815ab2930e45999ac3b195c8a8eb7207fca7c1cb4fca04aa61783b79", "ja": "おお、なんて悪そうなんだ……！\nこの役、じつは響のハマり役だったんだな？", "zh": "哦，真是坏透了……！\n原来这个角色其实很适合响嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "972dfef384078b238d4ad93705559ec05bee2127d4127207d351516c04c84540", "ja": "自分もそう思うぞ！　ふっふっふ、本番では自分と\n怪獣たちのあまりのカッコよさに、震えるがいいさー！", "zh": "我也这么觉得！嘿嘿嘿，正式演出时，就尽管为我和怪兽们帅气得不得了的模样发抖吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1016_p", "source_sha256": "dc8f8cd326bff067dd0580591d01c391a759af56689136ec5d86419acf7b1719", "ja": "（そして、本番では……）", "zh": "（然后，在正式演出时……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "4d5a50927cdeb91d4f9ae44becf3d28326d6dd6684cb4e6a2c87cb26da21323e", "ja": "あーっはっはっは！　お前たちの力はこの程度か！\nさあ、デストラオンよ！　とどめを刺すのだー！", "zh": "啊——哈哈哈哈！你们的力量就只有这种程度吗！\n来吧，毁灭翁！给他们最后一击吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "a46ac797d79d93b3164790922276a41039dff89be12b22b22dc77066930f65d9", "ja": "え、ビルの角に足の小指をぶつけた！？　うぎゃーっ、\nコンクリートは固いから気をつけてって言ったのに～！", "zh": "哎，你把脚的小拇趾撞到大楼墙角了！？呜哇——我不是说过混凝土很硬，要小心的吗～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0624_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d252b0c71920ccc9f108ef71cfb3e8215ba93b4392557acd731b7574983014e1", "ja": "（響の演技は最高にパワフルで魅力的だった。\nこれは大評判間違いなしだな！）", "zh": "（响的演技既充满力量又极具魅力。肯定会大受好评！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
